# Netlify CLI local state (site link / cache)
.netlify

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Media assets are NOT version-controlled — this repo tracks CODE ONLY
# (HTML / CSS / JS / config). Photos and videos live on disk and in
# Google Drive, and reach the live site via `netlify deploy` (which
# uploads from disk, not from git). The drone video also exceeds
# GitHub's 100 MB limit, so it could never be committed anyway.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png
*.PNG
*.jpg
*.JPG
*.jpeg
*.JPEG
*.webp
*.WEBP
*.gif
*.ico
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
